  "extractedTextPreview": "Expungement/Removal\nRequest\nForm\nPLEASE\nCHOOSE\nAPPROPRIATE\nREQUEST\nTYPE: ☐ Misdemeanor Conviction Expungement- (One Time Privilege)- Per MCA Title 46, Chapter 18, Part 11.\nSUBMISSION\nMUST\nINCLUDE: • FD-258 Blue Applicant Fingerprint Card • Original Court Judgement • District Court Order of the Expungement ☐ Marijuana Conviction Expungement- MCA Title 16, Chapter 12, Part 1.\nSUBMISSION\nMUST\nINCLUDE: • Original Court Judgment • Court Order of the Expungement ☐ Non-Conviction Removal- MCA Title 44, Chapter 5, Part 2.\nSUBMISSION\nMUST\nINCLUDE: • Court Judgment ☐ Deferred Imposition/Prosecution: Dismissed –\nCriminal\nJustice\nRecord\nSealing\nSUBMISSION\nMUST\nINCLUDE: • Original Court Judgment • Court Order Dismissing Deferred Imposition/Prosecutions I, (print legibly) _______________________________________________ respectfully request an Expungement of a Conviction/Removal of an arrest, that occurred on (date of arrest/fingerprinted) ________________________. I was charged and fingerprinted for [(list charge(s)]: _____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________ _____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________ _____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________ _____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________\nDate of\nBirth: ______________________ Last 4-digits of Social Security Number(optional): _______________\nReturn\nAddress: ________________________________________________________ ________________________________________________________\nPhone\nNumber: __________________________ E-mail: ___________________________\nSignature: _______________________________\nDate: ____________________________ Mail Requests to CRISS Expungement, 2225 11th Ave. PO Box 201403, Helena, MT 59620\nFor\nQuestions\nCall: 406-444-3625 CRISS will provide a confirmation letter once request is processed. Allow 30 Days For Processing",
